form":{"a":1,"b":0,"c":0,"d":1,"tx":184.6298828125,"ty":198}}},"id":"5c1ce848-45e4-4938-b98a-3771d2a25148","transform":{"a":1,"b":0,"c":0,"d":1,"tx":-7080.3701171875,"ty":-11481},"style":{"fill":{"type":"solid","color":{"mode":"RGB","value":{"r":203,"g":213,"b":255}}},"stroke":{"type":"none","color":{"mode":"RGB","value":{"r":112,"g":112,"b":112}},"width":1,"align":"inside"}},"shape":{"type":"path","path":"M 0 0 L 45.6494140625 0 L 45.6494140625 45.6513671875 L 0 45.6513671875 L 0 0 Z"}},{"type":"text","name":"2","meta":{"ux":{"nameL10N":"SHAPE_GROUP","constraintLeft":true,"constraintWidth":true,"constraintTop":true,"constraintHeight":true,"singleTextObject":true,"rangedStyles":[{"length":1,"linkId":"","fontFamily":"Roboto","fontStyle":"Black","postscriptName":"Roboto-Black","fontSize":30,"charSpacing":0,"underline":false,"textTransform":"none","textScript":"none","fill":{"value":4279379519},"strikethrough":false,"hyperlinkUrl":""}],"localTransform":{"a":1,"b":0,"c":0,"d":1,"tx":207.62939453125,"ty":231}}},"id":"f4e1ac97-3344-4a41-83cf-854362d0e614","transform":{"a":1,"b":0,"c":0,"d":1,"tx":-7057.37060546875,"ty":-11448},"style":{"fill":{"type":"solid","color":{"mode":"RGB","value":{"r":18,"g":38,"b":63}}},"font":{"postscriptName":"Roboto-Black","family":"Roboto","style":"Black","size":30},"textAttributes":{"lineHeight":35,"paragraphAlign":"center"}},"text":{"frame":{"type":"positioned"},"paragraphs":[{"lines":[[{"y":0,"from":0,"to":1,"x":-8.6865234375}]]}],"rawText":"2"}},{"type":"shape","name":"Línea 106","meta":{"ux":{"nameL10N":"SHAPE_LINE","constraintLeft":true,"constraintRight":true,"constraintTop":true,"constraintHeight":true,"localTransform":{"a":1,"b":0,"c":0,"d":1,"tx":185.0712890625,"ty":263.5}}},"id":"ca20ae89-5d84-463f-87b1-d65e7ebd5c53","transform":{"a":1,"b":0,"c":0,"d":1,"tx":-7079.9287109375,"ty":-11415.5},"style":{"stroke":{"type":"solid","color":{"mode":"RGB","value":{"r":219,"g":218,"b":218}},"width":3}},"shape":{"type":"line","x1":0,"y1":0,"x2":1230,"y2":0}},{"type":"text","name":"En el contexto de las organizaciones contemporáneas, la capacidad de trabajar en equipo y de manera colaborativa es considerada una de las competencias más valoradas y necesarias. Las tareas que enfrentan las organizaciones son cada vez más complejas y req","meta":{"ux":{"nameL10N":"SHAPE_GROUP","constraintWidth":true,"constraintRight":true,"constraintTop":true,"constraintHeight":true,"singleTextObject":true,"rangedStyles":[{"length":1094,"linkId":"","fontFamily":"Roboto","fontStyle":"Regular","postscriptName":"Roboto-Regular","fontSize":16,"charSpacing":2.5,"underline":false,"textTransform":"none","textScript":"none","fill":{"value":4279379519},"strikethrough":false,"hyperlinkUrl":""}],"localTransform":{"a":1,"b":0,"c":0,"d":1,"tx":497,"ty":316}}},"id":"228bdd8b-bab8-44dd-8374-eaef70a83bb7","transform":{"a":1,"b":0,"c":0,"d":1,"tx":-6768,"ty":-11363},"style":{"fill":{"type":"solid","color":{"mode":"RGB","value":{"r":18,"g":38,"b":63}}},"font":{"postscriptName":"Roboto-Regular","family":"Roboto","style":"Regular","size":16},"textAttributes":{"letterSpacing":2.5,"lineHeight":24}},"text":{"frame":{"type":"autoHeight","width":915.6298828125},"paragraphs":[{"lines":[[{"y":15,"from":0,"to":116,"x":0}],[{"y":39,"from":116,"to":237,"x":0}],[{"y":63,"from":237,"to":362,"x":0}],[{"y":87,"from":362,"to":396,"x":0}]]}],"rawText":"En el contexto de las organizaciones contemporáneas, la capacidad de trabajar en equipo y de manera colaborativa es considerada una de las competencias más valoradas y necesarias. Las tareas que enfrentan las organizaciones son cada vez más complejas y requieren la integración de diferentes habilidades, perspectivas y conocimientos que ningún individuo por sí solo puede poseer en su totalidad."}},{"type":"text","name":"El trabajo en equipo y el trabajo colaborativo no son modalidades excluyentes; en la práctica, las organizaciones combinan ambas según el tipo de desafío que enfrentan. Lo que determina la efectividad no es elegir una sobre la otra, sino reconocer cuándo c","meta":{"ux":{"nameL10N":"SHAPE_GROUP","constraintWidth":true,"constraintRight":true,"constraintHeight":true,"singleTextObject":true,"rangedStyles":[{"length":1094,"linkId":"","fontFamily":"Roboto","fontStyle":"Regular","postscriptName":"Roboto-Regular","fontSize":16,"charSpacing":2.5,"underline":false,"textTransform":"none","textScript":"none","fill":{"value":4279379519},"strikethrough":false,"hyperlinkUrl":""}],"localTransform":{"a":1,"b":0,"c":0,"d":1,"tx":289,"ty":3476}}},"id":"0efc63f2-8a4e-4f7b-b3f5-5a255f7a8716","transform":{"a":1,"b":0,"c":0,"d":1,"tx":-6976,"ty":-8203},"style":{"fill":{"type":"solid","color":{"mode":"RGB","value":{"r":18,"g":38,"b":63}}},"font":{"postscriptName":"Roboto-Regular","family":"Roboto","style":"Regular","size":16},"textAttributes":{"letterSpacing":2.5,"lineHeight":24}},"text":{"frame":{"type":"autoHeight","width":1124},"paragraphs":[{"lines":[[{"y":15,"from":0,"to":154,"x":0}],[{"y":39,"from":154,"to":306,"x":0}],[{"y":63,"from":306,"to":460,"x":0}],[{"y":87,"from":460,"to":612,"x":0}],[{"y":111,"from":612,"to":625,"x":0}]]}],"rawText":"El trabajo en equipo y el trabajo colaborativo no son modalidades excluyentes; en la práctica, las organizaciones combinan ambas según el tipo de desafío que enfrentan. Lo que determina la efectividad no es elegir una sobre la otra, sino reconocer cuándo cada una aporta mayor valor: el primero, cuando la eficiencia operativa depende de la especialización y la coordinación; el segundo, cuando la complejidad del problema exige la inteligencia colectiva y la construcción conjunta de soluciones. El gestor de talento humano cumple un papel central en crear las condiciones para que ambas prosperen dentro de la organización."}},{"type":"text","name":"Reconocida la distinción entre ambas modalidades, surge una pregunta central: ¿qué condiciones hacen posible que la colaboración sea efectiva? Los principios que la sustentan se desarrollan en el siguiente apartado.","meta":{"ux":{"nameL10N":"SHAPE_GROUP","constraintLeft":true,"constraintRight":true,"constraintHeight":true,"singleTextObject":true,"rangedStyles":[{"length":1094,"linkId":"","fontFamily":"Roboto","fontStyle":"Regular","postscriptName":"Roboto-Regular","fontSize":16,"charSpacing":2.5,"underline":false,"textTransform":"none","textScript":"none","fill":{"value":4279379519},"strikethrough":false,"hyperlinkUrl":""}],"localTransform":{"a":1,"b":0,"c":0,"d":1,"tx":185,"ty":3832}}},"id":"99d9daac-6682-47f1-b531-bf2fc2fe550a","transform":{"a":1,"b":0,"c":0,"d":1,"tx":-7080,"ty":-7847},"style":{"fill":{"type":"solid","color":{"mode":"RGB","value":{"r":18,"g":38,"b":63}}},"font":{"postscriptName":"Roboto-Regular","family":"Roboto","style":"Regular","size":16},"textAttributes":{"letterSpacing":2.5,"lineHeight":24}},"text":{"frame":{"type":"autoHeight","width":1228},"paragraphs":[{"lines":[[{"y":15,"from":0,"to":165,"x":0}],[{"y":39,"from":165,"to":215,"x":0}]]}],"rawText":"Reconocida la distinción entre ambas modalidades, surge una pregunta central: ¿qué condiciones hacen posible que la colaboración sea efectiva? Los principios que la sustentan se desarrollan en el siguiente apartado."}},{"type":"text","name":"Las empresas afrontan entornos cambiantes y estructuras cada vez más diversas, la capacidad de trabajar en equipo y de forma colaborativa se convierte en un factor diferenciador. Organizaciones del sector público, pymes, cooperativas y grandes empresas enc","meta":{"ux":{"nameL10N":"SHAPE_GROUP","constraintWidth":true,"constraintRight":true,"constraintTop":true,"constraintHeight":true,"singleTextObject":true,"rangedStyles":[{"length":1094,"linkId":"","fontFamily":"Roboto","fontStyle":"Regular","postscriptName":"Roboto-Regular","fontSize":16,"charSpacing":2.5,"underline":false,"textTransform":"none","textScript":"none","fill":{"value":4279379519},"strikethrough":false,"hyperlinkUrl":""}],"localTransform":{"a":1,"b":0,"c":0,"d":1,"tx":289,"ty":625}}},"id":"adffe19f-db15-48e2-9fb9-b91a6fe1fb82","transform":{"a":1,"b":0,"c":0,"d":1,"tx":-6976,"ty":-11054},"style":{"fill":{"type":"solid","color":{"mode":"RGB","value":{"r":18,"g":38,"b":63}}},"font":{"postscriptName":"Roboto-Regular","family":"Roboto","style":"Regular","size":16},"textAttributes":{"letterSpacing":2.5,"lineHeight":24}},"text":{"frame":{"type":"autoHeight","width":1124},"paragraphs":[{"lines":[[{"y":15,"from":0,"to":154,"x":0}],[{"y":39,"from":154,"to":308,"x":0}],[{"y":63,"from":308,"to":402,"x":0}]]}],"rawText":"Las empresas afrontan entornos cambiantes y estructuras cada vez más diversas, la capacidad de trabajar en equipo y de forma colaborativa se convierte en un factor diferenciador. Organizaciones del sector público, pymes, cooperativas y grandes empresas encuentran en estas modalidades una vía para potenciar sus recursos, distribuir responsabilidades y generar soluciones más innovadoras y sostenibles."}},{"type":"text","name":"Para comprender el alcance de estas modalidades de trabajo, es útil precisar los conceptos fundamentales que las sustentan. Los siguientes términos constituyen la base conceptual del trabajo colaborativo y en equipo en el entorno organizacional:","meta":{"ux":{"nameL10N":"SHAPE_GROUP","constraintLeft":true,"constraintRight":true,"constraintTop":true,"constraintHeight":true,"singleTextObject":true,"rangedStyles":[{"length":1094,"linkId":"","fontFamily":"Roboto","fontStyle":"Regular","postscriptName":"Roboto-Regular","fontSize":16,"charSpacing":2.5,"underline":false,"textTransform":"none","textScript":"none","fill":{"value":4279379519},"strikethrough":false,"hyperlinkUrl":""}],"localTransform":{"a":1,"b":0,"c":0,"d":1,"tx":185,"ty":739}}},"id":"14877d02-5e8a-40be-b566-5f8a7a8aa2eb","transform":{"a":1,"b":0,"c":0,"d":1,"tx":-7080,"ty":-10940},"style":{"fill":{"type":"solid","color":{"mode":"RGB","value":{"r":18,"g":38,"b":63}}},"font":{"postscriptName":"Roboto-Regular","family":"Roboto","style":"Regular","size":16},"textAttribu