,"localTransform":{"a":1,"b":0,"c":0,"d":1,"tx":289,"ty":812}}},"id":"f9d78740-35ab-4aa4-b963-9d392a3bed83","transform":{"a":1,"b":0,"c":0,"d":1,"tx":-6976,"ty":-10867},"style":{"fill":{"type":"solid","color":{"mode":"RGB","value":{"r":247,"g":227,"b":230}}},"stroke":{"type":"none","color":{"mode":"RGB","value":{"r":112,"g":112,"b":112}},"width":1,"align":"inside"}},"shape":{"type":"path","path":"M 0 0 L 1019.999938964844 0 L 1019.999938964844 360 L 0 360 L 0 0 Z"}},{"type":"text","name":"Trabajo en equipo: grupo de personas que coordina acciones hacia un objetivo común, con roles definidos y responsabilidades individuales claras. \n\nTrabajo colaborativo: enfoque en el que los integrantes construyen soluciones de manera conjunta, compartiend","meta":{"ux":{"nameL10N":"SHAPE_GROUP","constraintWidth":true,"constraintTop":true,"constraintHeight":true,"singleTextObject":true,"rangedStyles":[{"length":730,"linkId":"","fontFamily":"Roboto","fontStyle":"Regular","postscriptName":"Roboto-Regular","fontSize":16,"charSpacing":2.5,"underline":false,"textTransform":"none","textScript":"none","fill":{"value":4279379519},"strikethrough":false,"hyperlinkUrl":""}],"localTransform":{"a":1,"b":0,"c":0,"d":1,"tx":334.37109375,"ty":837}}},"id":"d095e2f1-b2c8-4788-91af-450893b3ca3e","transform":{"a":1,"b":0,"c":0,"d":1,"tx":-6930.62890625,"ty":-10842},"style":{"fill":{"type":"solid","color":{"mode":"RGB","value":{"r":18,"g":38,"b":63}}},"font":{"postscriptName":"Roboto-Regular","family":"Roboto","style":"Regular","size":16},"textAttributes":{"letterSpacing":2.5,"lineHeight":24}},"text":{"frame":{"type":"autoHeight","width":952},"paragraphs":[{"lines":[[{"y":15,"from":0,"to":124,"x":0}],[{"y":39,"from":124,"to":145,"x":0}]]},{"lines":[[{"y":63,"from":146,"to":146,"x":0}]]},{"lines":[[{"y":87,"from":147,"to":277,"x":0}],[{"y":111,"from":277,"to":308,"x":0}]]},{"lines":[[{"y":135,"from":309,"to":309,"x":0}]]},{"lines":[[{"y":159,"from":310,"to":432,"x":0}]]},{"lines":[[{"y":183,"from":433,"to":433,"x":0}]]},{"lines":[[{"y":207,"from":434,"to":562,"x":0}],[{"y":231,"from":562,"to":573,"x":0}]]},{"lines":[[{"y":255,"from":574,"to":574,"x":0}]]},{"lines":[[{"y":279,"from":575,"to":707,"x":0}],[{"y":303,"from":707,"to":730,"x":0}]]}],"rawText":"Trabajo en equipo: grupo de personas que coordina acciones hacia un objetivo común, con roles definidos y responsabilidades individuales claras. \n\nTrabajo colaborativo: enfoque en el que los integrantes construyen soluciones de manera conjunta, compartiendo la responsabilidad por el proceso y el resultado. \n\nSinergia: capacidad del grupo para generar resultados superiores a los que cada integrante lograría de manera individual. \n\nInterdependencia: condición en la que el avance de cada persona depende del aporte de las demás, lo que fortalece el compromiso colectivo. \n\nInteligencia colectiva: habilidad del grupo para tomar decisiones y resolver problemas de manera más efectiva que cualquiera de sus miembros por separado. "}},{"type":"shape","name":"circle-right-solid-full","id":"0d45f911-938c-42f2-872a-943cf921d9b1","transform":{"a":1,"b":0,"c":0,"d":1,"tx":-7020,"ty":-10906},"meta":{"ux":{"hasCustomName":true,"hasNameFromExternalSource":true,"aspectLock":{"width":512,"height":512},"constraintWidth":true,"constraintTop":true,"constraintHeight":true,"localTransform":{"a":1,"b":0,"c":0,"d":1,"tx":245,"ty":773}}},"style":{"fill":{"type":"solid","color":{"mode":"RGB","value":{"r":71,"g":74,"b":89}}},"stroke":{"type":"none","color":{"mode":"RGB","value":{"r":112,"g":112,"b":112}},"width":1}},"shape":{"type":"path","path":"M 64 72 C 64 76.41874694824219 67.58125305175781 80 72 80 C 76.41874694824219 80 80 76.41874694824219 80 72 C 80 67.58125305175781 76.41874694824219 64 72 64 C 67.58125305175781 64 64 67.58125305175781 64 72 Z M 76.10312652587891 72.35312652587891 L 72.85312652587891 75.60312652587891 C 72.70938110351562 75.74687194824219 72.49375152587891 75.78750610351562 72.30937194824219 75.71250152587891 